WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.240
Keeping up with marketing takes time most
business owners don’t have.

00:04.500 --> 00:05.120
Search.

00:05.620 --> 00:06.240
Advertising.

00:06.660 --> 00:07.540
Local visibility.

00:08.160 --> 00:09.440
Now AI.

00:10.240 --> 00:11.900
More tools to learn.

00:11.920 --> 00:13.320
More decisions to make.

00:13.460 --> 00:15.900
And the feeling that you should be doing
more.

00:16.260 --> 00:20.260
Agencies bring expertise, but the work can
feel distant between meetings

00:20.280 --> 00:21.480
and monthly reports.

00:22.160 --> 00:25.300
Software gives you access, but leaves you
connecting the tools and

00:25.320 --> 00:26.820
figuring out what to do next.

00:27.200 --> 00:29.900
We built Impackt Media to bring it all
together.

00:30.140 --> 00:35.400
One platform for SEO, AEO, GEO, and paid
advertising—connecting

00:35.420 --> 00:38.380
how customers discover your business with
the work that helps you

00:38.400 --> 00:39.020
grow.

00:39.200 --> 00:41.300
SEO helps you get found in search.

00:41.680 --> 00:44.480
GEO strengthens your presence in the places
you serve.

00:45.020 --> 00:48.220
AEO helps your business become part of the
answers people find

00:48.240 --> 00:49.080
through AI.

00:49.580 --> 00:52.460
Paid advertising puts your business in
front of the right audiences,

00:52.720 --> 00:55.320
with campaigns guided by your goals and
budget.

00:55.580 --> 00:58.400
Together, they give your marketing a shared
direction.

00:58.700 --> 01:01.800
Behind the platform is something that took
years to develop.

01:02.020 --> 01:04.620
Before we built the platform, we ran the
agency.

01:05.000 --> 01:09.040
We helped businesses grow, managed real
advertising budgets, and built

01:09.060 --> 01:10.300
businesses of our own.

01:10.420 --> 01:12.220
We learned which questions to ask.

01:12.460 --> 01:14.220
Which opportunities deserved attention.

01:14.240 --> 01:16.820
And which decisions needed a closer look.

01:17.040 --> 01:19.180
That experience shaped the system.

01:19.580 --> 01:23.500
Entrepreneurs, marketing specialists, and
finance experts helped turn

01:23.520 --> 01:27.460
real-world knowledge into the workflows,
priorities, and checks behind the

01:27.480 --> 01:28.100
platform.

01:28.540 --> 01:31.740
Powering it is Samaritan—our AI engine and
agents that

01:31.760 --> 01:35.900
research opportunities, prepare content,
and carry work forward across your

01:35.920 --> 01:37.480
search presence and advertising.

01:37.610 --> 01:42.260
Experienced people remain part of that
system, guiding strategy, reviewing the

01:42.280 --> 01:44.600
work, and overseeing advertising budgets.

01:44.960 --> 01:47.260
Open your workspace and see the progress.

01:47.900 --> 01:48.580
SEO improvements.

01:49.180 --> 01:50.280
Local search opportunities.

01:50.640 --> 01:52.760
Content prepared for AI discovery.

01:53.300 --> 01:54.620
Paid campaign recommendations.

01:55.260 --> 01:56.580
Work ready for approval.

01:56.800 --> 01:57.720
Changes recorded.

01:58.620 --> 01:59.340
Performance in view.

01:59.700 --> 02:00.460
Have a new priority?

02:00.900 --> 02:01.620
Give it direction.

02:02.160 --> 02:05.840
Your business context connects the people
and technology working on it.

02:05.960 --> 02:09.640
You spend less time coordinating your
marketing, with more clarity about

02:09.660 --> 02:11.620
what’s happening and what comes next.

02:12.240 --> 02:13.840
Technology built from experience.

02:14.420 --> 02:16.640
Human judgment connected to execution.

02:16.750 --> 02:18.010
Impackt Media.
